---
import ReferenceLayout from "../layouts/ReferenceLayout.astro";
const namespace = "https://xmlsquish.moesegfault.dev/ns";
const elements = [
  ["module", "Source declaration container and implicit main.", "源码声明容器及隐式 main。"],
  ["import", "Load definitions without executing a frame.", "装载定义，不执行调用帧。"],
  ["macro", "Define an immutable namespace-qualified macro.", "定义不可重定义的命名宏。"],
  ["param", "Declare a required Unicode-string parameter.", "声明必需的 Unicode 字符串参数。"],
  ["mount", "Call a statically referenced source unit's main.", "调用静态引用源码的 main。"],
  ["call", "Invoke a statically resolved macro QName.", "调用静态解析的限定名宏。"],
  ["arg", "Pass a literal, binding or text-only expanded body.", "传入字面量、绑定或纯文本展开主体。"],
  ["fill", "Evaluate an XML sequence in the caller.", "在调用方求值 XML 序列。"],
  ["slot", "Insert an explicitly provided XML sequence.", "插入显式传入的 XML 序列。"],
  ["insert", "Emit an escaped scalar as text, never markup.", "将标量转义为文本，不重新解析为标记。"],
  ["ifr", "Match a Unicode scalar with lexical named captures.", "匹配 Unicode 字符串，建立词法命名捕获。"],
];
const example = '<xs:module xmlns:xs="https://xmlsquish.moesegfault.dev/ns">\n  <Prompt>Hello, xmlsquish.</Prompt>\n</xs:module>';
---
<ReferenceLayout title="xmlsquish XML namespace" description="Canonical namespace identity, vocabulary and versioned specification resources for xmlsquish." path="/ns">
  <Fragment slot="head">
    <link rel="describedby" href="/ns/0.2.0/dsl.md" type="text/markdown" />
    <link rel="version-history" href="/releases/" />
  </Fragment>
  <p>XML NAMESPACE · xmlsquish 0.2.0</p>
  <h1>XML is data.<br />Macros are computation.</h1>
  <p class="identity"><strong>Namespace name / 命名空间名称</strong><br /><code>{namespace}</code></p>
  <p>This namespace document describes the built-in XML vocabulary of xmlsquish. It is not an XML Schema (XSD), and is not fetched when compiling a program.</p>
  <p lang="zh-CN">本页是内建 XML 词汇的命名空间文档（Namespace Document），不是 XML Schema，也不是编译时需要访问的服务。</p>
  <h2 id="identity">Identity / 身份规则</h2>
  <pre><code>{example}</code></pre>
  <p>Use the exact HTTPS URI above, <strong>without a trailing slash</strong>. Prefixes such as <code>xs</code> are lexical aliases. Namespace names are compared as case-sensitive strings: HTTP, HTTPS, a trailing slash and a version suffix identify different namespaces. A browser redirect does not change this identity.</p>
  <p lang="zh-CN">必须使用上方精确 URI，<strong>不加末尾斜杠</strong>。前缀仅是词法别名；URI 按区分大小写的字符串比较。浏览器可能将本页重定向到带斜杠的文档地址，但这不改变 XML 命名空间身份。</p>
  <p>Ordinary attributes such as <code>name</code>, <code>src</code> and <code>get</code> are unqualified. Macro <code>name</code>/<code>ref</code> values are prefixed QNames resolved at their lexical site. User macros must use another namespace.</p>
  <p lang="zh-CN">指令属性不带命名空间；宏名与引用是带前缀的限定名（QName），按词法位置解析。用户宏不得定义在内建命名空间中。</p>
  <h2 id="resources">Resources / 规范资源</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/ns/0.2.0/dsl.md" rel="describedby">0.2.0 normative DSL specification / 规范性语言文档（简体中文）</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/kleedaisuki/prompt-squish/blob/v0.2.0/docs/dsl.md">Tagged specification / 发布标签中的规范</a></li>
    <li><a href="/releases/">Release notes and migration / 发布与迁移说明</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://github.com/kleedaisuki/prompt-squish/tree/v0.2.0/examples">Executable examples / 可运行示例</a></li>
    <li><a href="/LICENSE.txt" rel="license">License / 许可证</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h2 id="vocabulary">Core vocabulary / 核心元素</h2>
  <table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Element</th><th scope="col">Contract / 契约</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    {elements.map(([name, en, zh]) => <tr id={name}><td><code>xs:{name}</code></td><td>{en}<br /><span lang="zh-CN">{zh}</span></td></tr>)}
  </tbody></table>
  <h2 id="validation">Validation / 验证边界</h2>
  <p>The compiler validates the complete static source closure, names, signatures, regex syntax and expansion results. No standalone XSD is advertised as a substitute: XML grammar alone cannot establish cross-file symbol identity, lexical captures or termination. Final <code>.o.xml</code> whitespace compression remains product behavior.</p>
  <p lang="zh-CN">完整验证由编译器完成。XML 文法不能替代跨文件符号、词法作用域与展开验证，因此本页不把 XSD 冒充完整语言验证器。最终 <code>.o.xml</code> 继续执行产品规定的空白压缩。</p>
  <h2 id="versioning">Version policy / 版本策略</h2>
  <p>The vocabulary URI is not the executable version. This page may gain documentation and resource links; versioned specifications remain at their published paths. 0.x releases may introduce breaking changes, recorded in release notes. Pin the executable tag and specification together; do not derive a namespace URI from a release number.</p>
  <p lang="zh-CN">词汇 URI 与程序版本分离。页面可补充说明和链接，已发布版本规范路径保持稳定。0.x 版本仍可能包含破坏性变更，必须在发布说明中列出；应同时锁定程序标签与规范，不要自行给命名空间 URI 拼接版本号。</p>
  <h2 id="standards">Standards basis / 标准依据</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/REC-xml-names/">W3C Namespaces in XML 1.0</a> — namespace identity and QName rules.</li>
    <li><a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/webarch/#namespace-document">W3C Web Architecture §4.5.4</a> — discoverable namespace documentation.</li>
    <li><a href="https://semver.org/">Semantic Versioning 2.0.0</a> — 0.x development-version policy.</li>
  </ul>
</ReferenceLayout>
